{"id":"a-inf-2179","category":"info","cover":"","region":"global","publishedAt":"2024-10-30","addedAt":"2026-10-13T11:56:48.679Z","tags":[],"title":{"zh":"24年10月新车灯光欣赏","en":"","ko":""},"summary":{"zh":"Renault Embleme Concept上榜理由：头灯很独特，由点到线、由细到粗的位置灯，有点像部落的脸部彩绘。尾灯的立体构成很简约，却极具震撼力。\n\nCitroen C5 ","en":"","ko":""},"body":{"zh":"Renault Embleme Concept上榜理由：头灯很独特，由点到线、由细到粗的位置灯，有点像部落的脸部彩绘。尾灯的立体构成很简约，却极具震撼力。\n\nCitroen C5 Aircross ConceptFord RS2.00 Concept上榜理由：两个车的大灯效果图给人感觉都很像电脑组件，或许代表了灯具科技感的营造趋势？\n\nRenault Twingo E-Tech Concept上榜理由：萌即正义。立体化的灯眉更增加了趣味性。\n\n其他车灯赏析Alpine A390 Beta Concept\n\nAudi A2 E-tron复刻版\n\n埃安 RT\n\nBMW Skytop\n\nCitroen Ami虽然是卤素灯碗，但也是经过用心设计的！中间的横向分割，也许灵感来自山水投射到半球反射碗上形成的黑白效果。\n\nCitroen C4这么有个性的灯，还是法国人会玩。\n\nFerrari F80就是要黑到极致，力求不破坏整块黑色面板的一体性。\n\nFord Expedition\n\nFord RS2.00 Concept前后灯都采用极其平滑的outlens，似乎是一种新趋势，强调简约科技。\n\nFoxtron Model D\n\nGeely Galaxy Starship 7\n\nHyundai Inster Cross\n\nKia Tasman\n\nLynk Co 02\n\nMitsubishi DST Concept\n\nMcLaren W1\n\nNissan Murano\n\nOpel Mokka\n\nRenault 4 E-Tech\n\nRolls-Royce Ghost Series II我缺的是灯吗？我缺的是那个双R标~透镜饰圈下方的高亮电镀和亚光镀，做了一个倾斜的分割，增添了一抹优雅。\n\nSkoda Elroq\n\nTesla Robotaxi Concept\n\nTouring Superleggera Veloce12\n\nVolkswagen Tayron\n\n——本月分享到此结束，谢谢观赏————所有图片均来自网络——","en":"","ko":""},"source":{"name":{"zh":"车灯研究院","en":"Headlight Institute","ko":"차灯연구원"},"type":"web","url":"https://www.dengdengschool.com/article/zaoxing/2179.html","author":""},"content":[{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaNZh33J50azYKUDricNicT104ibmkhJK3vKex0gficSaaBqKxrNibZjLtjtrqkCqvXiaFlgJhLS5rpXNrrg/640?wx_fmt=png&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1&wx_co=1"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/bfpNckwxSiaOlTyG148O1TjiaT7GicicPE14nL0HLclW3E7pY8vaV22viaXA91RNS9nv4XjuWv4IcG9r2lHObfy3zmQ/640?wx_fmt=gif"},{"t":"text","v":"Renault Embleme Concept上榜理由：头灯很独特，由点到线、由细到粗的位置灯，有点像部落的脸部彩绘。尾灯的立体构成很简约，却极具震撼力。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bfpNckwxSiaOSth1UZCxibxhslyqQYbicVib7djXG7FucaCEdGMhEabanKNb1ic5xB4kdEVJyl